    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Martin O'Connor Estate Agents are delighted to offer for sale by Private Treaty this spacious two-bedroom ground-floor apartment, ideally located at Túr Éanna on the Upper Clybaun Road in the highly sought-after residential area of Knocknacarra, Galway.No. 1 enjoys an excellent position within this established development of just eight residential units and has the particular advantage of its own private side garden, providing valuable outdoor space rarely found with apartment living.The accommodation is well proportioned throughout and includes a welcoming entrance hall leading to a spacious open-plan kitchen, living and dining area with direct access to the private garden. There are two generous double bedrooms, both of which benefit from en-suite shower rooms, together with a separate guest washroom and hot press. The property also benefits from underfloor heating in the living / kitchen / dining area.The location is particularly convenient, with an excellent range of amenities within walking distance including local schools, shops, Gateway Shopping Park, Tesco, the Clybaun Hotel, NRG Fitness and Sheridan's Bar & Restaurant. The area is also well served by public transport, with convenient access to Galway City Centre and surrounding areas.A host of recreational amenities are close at hand including Cappagh Park, Barna Woods and Rusheen Bay, while Salthill Promenade, Silverstrand Beach and Barna Village are all within a short drive.With its spacious accommodation, ground-floor position, private garden and excellent location, No. 1 Túr Éanna would make an ideal home for a first-time buyer, downsizer or anyone wishing to enjoy the convenience of living in one of Galway City's most established residential areas. The property also presents an attractive opportunity for investors seeking a well-located apartment within easy reach of Galway City.Viewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this superbly located property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance - \n\n\nKitchen / Living / Dining Room - \nBright and spacious open-plan living space incorporating the kitchen and dining area, with direct access to the private side garden.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nWell-proportioned double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and adjoining en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite - \nFitted with shower, toilet and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nSpacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and adjoining en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite - \nFitted with shower, toilet and wash hand basin.\n\nGuest Washroom - \nFitted with toilet and wash hand basin.\n\nHot Press - \nProviding useful storage space.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Spacious two-bedroom ground-floor apartment</li><li> Private side garden with direct access from the living area</li><li> Block built storage shed</li><li> Private off-road residents' car park</li><li> Bright open-plan kitchen, living and dining space</li><li> Two double bedrooms, both with en-suite shower rooms</li><li> Built-in wardrobes to both bedrooms</li><li> Underfloor heating in living / dining / kitchen area</li><li> Established development of just eight residential units</li><li> Excellent Knocknacarra location close to a host of amenities</li><li> Convenient to Galway City Centre, Salthill and Barna</li><li> Management Fee approx. 1,300 per annum by Galway Property Management</ul>"
      },
